# This directory holds all generated data files (git-ignored).
# Files written here:
#   raw_spans.jsonl      - raw API output
#   spans.jsonl          - normalised spans
#   embeddings.npy       - float32 [N, dim] embedding matrix
#   macro_clusters.json  - top-level clusters
#   micro_clusters.json  - subclusters per macro cluster
#   report.md            - human-readable summary
